## Model card

- **Name:** Solar Mini 4
- **Short description:** Upstage’s Solar Mini 4 is a compact proprietary reasoning MoE model (35B total/3B active, 512K context class) positioned for efficient long-context text reasoning.
- **Provider / access:** Upstage API / hosted providers. Local metadata lists `upstage/solar-mini4`, pricing ~$0.10/$0.40 list (promo $0.05/$0.20), and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Upstage console docs page reviewed 2026-11-10 but did not yield extractable standardized benchmark numerics in this pass. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated.
- **IDs:** `solar-mini4`, `upstage/solar-mini4`.
- **Context window:** 524,288 tokens total; 131,072 max output (metadata; AA states 1M in some contexts).
- **Modalities:** Text input/output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** List $0.10/$0.40 per 1M in/out, $0.01 cached; promo $0.05/$0.20 through 2026-10-23 per metadata.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary closed MoE model (35B total/3B active per metadata). No open weights.

